<h2 id="job-change">Become a Trickster</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Reach <strong>Orphan Job Level 10</strong>.</li>
  <li>Speak to <strong>Lorelei Sorin</strong> in the Orphanage at <strong>va_orpha 376, 129</strong>. Choose the cold-hearted answer to earn her trust.</li>
  <li>Touch the wisp in the same room at <strong>va_orpha 391, 133</strong> to enter the hidden chamber.</li>
  <li>Find <strong>Serin</strong> in the crypt at <strong>que_trck01 197, 198</strong> and win her number-guessing game.</li>
</ol>
<p>You become a Trickster and receive Serin's scythe. Bring your Exchange Voucher to Ornstein in the smithy for starter equipment.</p>

<h2 id="combat">Weapons and skills</h2>
<p>Equip a <strong>scythe</strong>. STR and LUK are the class's listed main stats. Use short attack rotations and life leech to sustain yourself, while watching your SP and cooldowns.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Scythe Reap and Sweeping Slash:</strong> close-range attacks that can critically hit. Sweeping Slash loses damage outside combos.</li>
  <li><strong>Hellraiser:</strong> a Fire attack around you that activates Finisher Ready. Refuge allows it before maximum skill level; Sweeping Slash hits three times during this window.</li>
  <li><strong>Burning Scythe:</strong> changes your weapon to Fire. Check the enemy's element before using it.</li>
  <li><strong>Shadow Parry:</strong> blocks physical hits while using a scythe, with a brief pause after a successful block.</li>
  <li><strong>Mirror Image:</strong> reflects eligible targeted magic, but increases incoming physical damage. Boss magic cannot be reflected.</li>
</ul>
<p>Check costs and prerequisites in the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/skills.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge skills database ↗</a>. Equipment, leveling routes, and a tested skill build still need review.</p>

<h2 id="next-jobs">Become a Revenant</h2>
<p>Reach <strong>Trickster Job Level 70</strong> to advance to <a href={withBase('classes/revenant/')}>Revenant</a>. Its job-change walkthrough is WIP.</p>
